Loom third-party notices
========================

Loom includes third-party software and data. This file records the material
that is copied into the source tree or assembled Loom distributions. Package
manager dependencies retain the license metadata and license files supplied by
their publishers. The production dashboard additionally ships a generated
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt containing the notices of the exact npm packages used
to build it.

