Runtime packages and dashboard assets
-------------------------------------

Python distributions installed in the container retain their own package
metadata and license files under the Python installation. They include
packages under permissive licenses and packages under MPL-2.0; those packages
remain separately licensed and Loom does not relicense them.

The dashboard includes JavaScript packages and the Inter and JetBrains Mono
font assets under their publishers' licenses, including MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0,
ISC, and the SIL Open Font License. Its build creates and embeds
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt from the installed production dependency tree so the
copyright and license text supplied with each package travels with the
compiled dashboard.
